Package: cdiscbuildeR
Title: A Package to Convert ODM XML to SDTM/ADaM Datasets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ming-Chun", "Chen", email = "hellomingchun@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R port of the cdiscbuilder Python package. It simplifies the transformation of clinical trial data from ODM (Operational Data Model) XML format into CDISC SDTM and ADaM datasets using configuration-driven mapping rules.
